# The built-in agent's `checklist` tool: each call's headline counts the
# list, the state strip shows it under its titled rule, and the note at the
# end of the next request reminds the model of the unfinished list.
mock-llm
start
wait "README.md"
key Alt+A
wait "Agent"
key Alt+Home Alt+F11
type "keep a checklist"
key Enter
wait "Reminded:" 20
expect "Updating the checklist ▸ 0/3 · Read the report"
expect "Updating the checklist ▸ 2/3 · Run the tests"
expect "╌╌ Checklist 2/3 ╌"
expect "✓ Flag the critical items"
expect "▸ Run the tests"
expect "Reminded: yes."
snapshot checklist
quit
